  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "jQuery HTML DOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "jQuery vs JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "jQuery was created in 2006 by John Resig.\nIt was designed to handle Browser Incompatibilities and to simplify HTML DOM Manipulation, Event Handling, Animations, and Ajax."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "However, after JavaScript Version 5 (2009), most of the jQuery utilities can be solved with a few lines of standard JavaScript:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Removing HTML Elements"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Remove an HTML element:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "$(\"#id02\").remove();",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_remove_element"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "document.getElementById(\"id02\").remove();",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_dom_remove_element"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Get Parent Element"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Return the parent of an HTML element:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myParent = $(\"#02\").parent().prop(\"nodeName\"); ;",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_getparent"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myParent = document.getElementById(\"02\").parentNode.nodeName;",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_dom_getparent"
    }
  ]
}
